    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/f796be8995184c5e3368e236dc659cef.poster.avif?t=1751159368\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/f796be8995184c5e3368e236dc659cef.webm?t=1751159368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/f796be8995184c5e3368e236dc659cef.mp4?t=1751159368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>BACKGROUND</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a post-apocalyptic world devoid of human life, the last vestiges of humanity's existence lie in the actions of abandoned service robots. These automata, designed to follow commands without question, continue to carry out their final orders long after their masters perished. Some maintain crumbling estates, tending to overgrown gardens and polishing furniture in empty mansions. Others patrol desolate streets, enforcing long-forgotten rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their unwavering loyalty creates a haunting world in which remnants of human civilization persist in strange, surreal ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time, some robots have developed quirks in their programming, leading to unexpected behaviours.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>GAMEPLAY</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your line, wait for a bite, and engage in a tense reeling battle to land your catch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/f8695a7643178c0ea99825742d413c4d.poster.avif?t=1751159368\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/f8695a7643178c0ea99825742d413c4d.webm?t=1751159368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/f8695a7643178c0ea99825742d413c4d.mp4?t=1751159368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and unlock new fishing areas as you progress, expanding your adventure across diverse environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/1c7e1d7fff3f2e935cb93cf8dc0eeb4b.poster.avif?t=1751159368\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/1c7e1d7fff3f2e935cb93cf8dc0eeb4b.webm?t=1751159368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/1c7e1d7fff3f2e935cb93cf8dc0eeb4b.mp4?t=1751159368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials, unlock, craft and enhance your fishing tackle for better fishing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/2c248b456be43982a2aaf70c8c894248.poster.avif?t=1751159368\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/2c248b456be43982a2aaf70c8c894248.webm?t=1751159368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/2c248b456be43982a2aaf70c8c894248.mp4?t=1751159368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your fishing setup to match your playstyle by choosing from a variety of rods, reels, and lines.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/b9b315a95498e915f57c2a1acebb9f3d.poster.avif?t=1751159368\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/b9b315a95498e915f57c2a1acebb9f3d.webm?t=1751159368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/b9b315a95498e915f57c2a1acebb9f3d.mp4?t=1751159368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>CONTENT</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse fish species, each with color variations. The number of species will continue to grow with future updates.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of fishing gear, including rods, reels, and fishing lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/f796be8995184c5e3368e236dc659cef.poster.avif?t=1751159368\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/f796be8995184c5e3368e236dc659cef.webm?t=1751159368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/f796be8995184c5e3368e236dc659cef.mp4?t=1751159368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>BACKGROUND</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a post-apocalyptic world devoid of human life, the last vestiges of humanity's existence lie in the actions of abandoned service robots. These automata, designed to follow commands without question, continue to carry out their final orders long after their masters perished. Some maintain crumbling estates, tending to overgrown gardens and polishing furniture in empty mansions. Others patrol desolate streets, enforcing long-forgotten rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their unwavering loyalty creates a haunting world in which remnants of human civilization persist in strange, surreal ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time, some robots have developed quirks in their programming, leading to unexpected behaviours.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>GAMEPLAY</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your line, wait for a bite, and engage in a tense reeling battle to land your catch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/f8695a7643178c0ea99825742d413c4d.poster.avif?t=1751159368\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/f8695a7643178c0ea99825742d413c4d.webm?t=1751159368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/f8695a7643178c0ea99825742d413c4d.mp4?t=1751159368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and unlock new fishing areas as you progress, expanding your adventure across diverse environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/1c7e1d7fff3f2e935cb93cf8dc0eeb4b.poster.avif?t=1751159368\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/1c7e1d7fff3f2e935cb93cf8dc0eeb4b.webm?t=1751159368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/1c7e1d7fff3f2e935cb93cf8dc0eeb4b.mp4?t=1751159368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials, unlock, craft and enhance your fishing tackle for better fishing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/2c248b456be43982a2aaf70c8c894248.poster.avif?t=1751159368\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/2c248b456be43982a2aaf70c8c894248.webm?t=1751159368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/2c248b456be43982a2aaf70c8c894248.mp4?t=1751159368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your fishing setup to match your playstyle by choosing from a variety of rods, reels, and lines.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/b9b315a95498e915f57c2a1acebb9f3d.poster.avif?t=1751159368\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/b9b315a95498e915f57c2a1acebb9f3d.webm?t=1751159368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437700/extras/b9b315a95498e915f57c2a1acebb9f3d.mp4?t=1751159368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>CONTENT</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse fish species, each with color variations. The number of species will continue to grow with future updates.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of fishing gear, including rods, reels, and fishing lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
